      "quote": "Inclusion criteria: (1) Studies involving LSTs with lesions measuring > 20 mm; (2) Comparative studies reporting primary and secondary outcomes of ESD versus EMR. Exclusion criteria: (1) Studies including LSTs < 20 mm or other lesions preventing outcome extraction; (2) Reviews, meta-analyses, letters, editorials; (3) Case reports/series or studies with < 30 patients per ESD/EMR group; (4) Animal studies.",
      "reason": "The manuscript explicitly lists inclusion and exclusion criteria, covering study population (LSTs > 20 mm), study design (comparative studies), and specific exclusions (e.g., sample size, publication type, animal studies)."
