      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "The main endoscopic techniques for LSTs include endoscopic submucosal dissection (ESD) and endoscopic mucosal resection (EMR). ... This systematic review aims to comprehensively evaluate the efficacy and safety of ESD and EMR for colorectal LSTs larger than 20 mm",
      "reason": "The review defines the comparison groups (ESD vs. EMR) clearly in the objectives and inclusion criteria, which are then used for the synthesis of outcomes like local recurrence, bleeding, and perforation."
    },
